# Default User Roles

Seed on install; see `permissions.mdc` for semantics.

## Shipped Roles

- `super_admin`: platform manage; all active modules; all-scope reporting.
- `tenant_admin`: tenant manage; all entitled modules; entitled-scope reporting.
- `facility_admin`: facility manage; facility modules; facility reporting.
- `integration_admin`: `integrations` and `reports_audit` manage; those modules' reporting.
- `doctor`: clinical care (OPD/IPD/ICU/theater/emergency as assigned); diagnostics; billing view; clinical reporting.
- `nurse`: nursing, triage, ward care (IPD/ICU as assigned); diagnostics assist; registry; nursing reporting.
- `receptionist`: `patient_registry`, queues/OPD desk; billing view; reception reporting.
- `accountant`: `billing`, `claims`; finance reporting.
- `pharmacist`: `pharmacy` dispense and stock; billing view; pharmacy reporting; no Patients registry (`/patients`)—patient details only via pharmacy/dashboard embeds.
- `laboratory_technician`: `lab` specimen and workflow; lab reporting.
- `radiographer`: `radiology` scan acquisition; scan-scope reporting.
- `radiologist`: `radiology` interpretation and review; interpretation reporting.
- `physiotherapist`: `physiotherapy` sessions and workflow; physiotherapy reporting.
- `discharge_planner`: `discharge` coordination; discharge reporting.
- `operations_staff`: `operations` tasks; operations reporting.
- `housekeeper`: `housekeeping` tasks and areas; housekeeping reporting.
- `biomedical_engineer`: `biomedical` equipment maintenance; biomedical reporting.
- `mortuary_attendant`: `mortuary` workflow; mortuary reporting.
- `hr_staff`: `hr` administration; HR reporting.
- `patient`: own patient data only; own-data reporting.
- `visitor_guest`: limited visitor info only; allowed-visitor reporting.

## Administration

- Admins may add custom roles with the same vocabulary.
- Reset must restore this matrix atomically; stay auditable.
- Failed changes must roll back completely.
- UI and API must deny unauthorized menus, actions, workflows.

